namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamDragDropOperation {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Interaction/DreamDragDropOperation.h#DreamDragDropOperation
    src   "What a drag MEANS, riding along with it. The pointer pipeline itself only knows geometry -- which\nwidget is dragging and where the pointer is -- and every consumer used to reconstruct meaning\nfrom that alone. This object carries the meaning: the payload being moved, a tag for cheap\nfiltering, and the drag visual to show under the cursor.\n\nCreated by the source when its drag begins (UDreamUIDragSource, or any code that writes it onto\nthe pointer's event data), read by targets on drop, and alive exactly as long as the drag: the\ninput module clears it wherever it clears DragWidget."
    text  "拖拽的真正含义随它一同传递。指针管线本身只知道几何信息——哪个\n控件正在拖拽、指针位于何处——而过去每个使用方都只能据此重建含义。\n此对象承载这些含义：正在移动的负载、用于低成本筛选的标签，以及\n要在光标下显示的拖动视觉。\n\n由源在其拖拽开始时创建（UDreamUIDragSource，或任何将其写入\n指针事件数据的代码），由目标在放置时读取，并且其生命周期与拖拽完全一致：\n输入模块在清除DragWidget的地方也会清除它。"
    state machine
}

DreamDragDropOperation:bDropWasHandled {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Interaction/DreamDragDropOperation.h#DreamDragDropOperation:bDropWasHandled
    src   "Set by the target that accepted the drop. What the source's end-of-drag reads to decide\nbetween \"it landed\" and \"it was cancelled\" -- writable so a Blueprint implementing the drop\ninterface directly can accept too."
    text  "由接受放置的目标设置。源的拖拽结束逻辑会读取它，以在\n“已落地”和“已取消”之间作出判断——它可写，因此直接实现放置\n接口的蓝图也能接受放置。"
    state machine
}

DreamDragDropOperation:DragVisualClass {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Interaction/DreamDragDropOperation.h#DreamDragDropOperation:DragVisualClass
    src   "Widget class shown under the cursor for the duration of the drag. Null shows nothing."
    text  "拖拽期间在光标下显示的控件类。为空时不显示任何内容。"
    state machine
}

DreamDragDropOperation:DragVisualOffset {
