    src   "Drag visual offset from the pointer, canvas units, X right Y up."
    text  "拖动视觉相对指针的偏移，画布单位，X向右，Y向上。"
    state machine
}

DreamDragDropOperation:NotifyDragCancelled {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Interaction/DreamDragDropOperation.h#DreamDragDropOperation:NotifyDragCancelled
    src   "Tell this operation its drag ended with nothing accepting it. Fires OnDragCancelled at most\nonce, whoever notices the end first.\n\nTwo things can notice, and only one of them used to: the source's own OnPointerEndDrag, and\nthe pointer pipeline clearing a drag directly. The pipeline's path only ran the source's, and\nonly when the source widget was still alive -- so a drag whose source was destroyed mid-flight\n(a recycled list row, a screen closed under the pointer) ended with no cancel at all and every\nOnDragCancelled handler waiting for a call that could no longer come. The cancel belongs to\nthe OPERATION, which outlives the widget that made it."
    text  "告知此操作：其拖拽已结束，且没有任何对象接受它。无论谁先察觉到结束，OnDragCancelled 最多\n触发一次。\n\n有两处可能察觉到，而过去只有其中一处：源自身的 OnPointerEndDrag，以及\n指针管线直接清除拖拽。管线的路径只运行源的那一套，而且\n仅在源控件仍然存活时运行——因此，如果拖拽的源在中途被销毁\n（被回收的列表行、在指针下方关闭的屏幕），拖拽就会完全得不到取消，所有\n等待一个再也无法到来的调用的 OnDragCancelled 处理程序也会落空。取消属于\n该操作，而该操作比创建它的控件存活得更久。"
    state machine
}

DreamDragDropOperation:OnDragCancelled {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Interaction/DreamDragDropOperation.h#DreamDragDropOperation:OnDragCancelled
    src   "Fired by the source when the drag ended with no target accepting."
    text  "当拖拽结束且没有目标接受时，由源触发。"
    state machine
}

DreamDragDropOperation:OnDropHandled {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Interaction/DreamDragDropOperation.h#DreamDragDropOperation:OnDropHandled
    src   "Fired by the accepting target, after its own handling."
    text  "由接受目标触发，在目标自身处理完成后。"
    state machine
}

